#: arkumu/templates/base.html:196 arkumu/templates/pages/home.html:10
msgid "arkumu_title"
msgstr "arkumu.nrw - Archives of Art and Music Universities"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:199 arkumu/templates/pages/home.html:11
msgid "arkumu_intro"
msgstr ""
"The art and music universities in North Rhine-Westphalia possess impressive "
"collections of (retro-)digital artistic content. Beyond their cultural "
"value, these are also significant as source data for advanced teaching and "
"research. The goal of the arkumu.nrw project is the high-quality "
"development, availability, and permanent archiving of these multimedia "
"contents."

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:201
msgid "arkumu_core_tasks_heading"
msgstr "Core tasks in the implementation include:"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:203
msgid "arkumu_task_1"
msgstr ""
"Transfer of data into the state's long-term availability storage structures"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:204
msgid "arkumu_task_2"
msgstr ""
"Standardization of professional indexing and storage according to library, "
"archival, technical, and media-aesthetic-artistic standards"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:205
msgid "arkumu_task_3"
msgstr ""
"Creation of a user-friendly web interface for artistic, scientific, and "
"public use"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:206
msgid "arkumu_task_4"
msgstr ""
"Multimedia-experienceable documentation of the excellent level of culture "
"and science in NRW"

#: arkumu/templates/base.html:209
msgid "arkumu_consortium"
msgstr ""
"arkumu.nrw is a consortium project of the Folkwang University of the Arts "
"Essen, the Academy of Media Arts Cologne, the University of Music and Dance "
"Cologne, and the Detmold University of Music, and the IT Center University "
"of Cologne (ITCC), under the consortium leadership of the Robert Schumann "
"University Düsseldorf, in cooperation with the North Rhine-Westphalian "
"Library Service Centre. A future expansion of the consortium to include "
"other interested universities or departments is explicitly desired."

